ll", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> Good news Miranda! Holly's has accepted the partnership with Polygon.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> Fantastic! We've been anticipating this. You weren't taken by surprise, were you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> No, I could sense Farmani was leaning our way.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> I felt that as soon as he gave us the extension. That was a strong indication, if you ask me.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> I think you really persuaded him.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> We all did! Congratulations!", "id": 1}, {"time": "30000", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> Everyone's worked hard. On that note, how do you want to celebrate this? Perhaps with a luncheon?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> I must say I like the idea. Should I look into a caterer?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> Yes. To be honest, you're good at that. By the way, what kind of diets do people follow?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> We have a few vegans and vegetarians. I could be wrong, but we have some employees on a high protein diet, so we need meat as well.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> How about you?", "id": 2}, {"time": "61000", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> I'm on a gluten-free, low-fat, and low-sodium diet.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> Sounds complicated. But, we haven't mentioned dessert. How do you feel about including some chocolate?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> Of course! I see chocolate on your desk everyday.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> I know. I'm addicted to it. Oh that reminds me, we should get a cake!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda:</span> Speaking of sweets, I'll bring us some coffees before we spend some time discussing where to go from here. How do you take yours?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet:</span> I take two creams and no sugar. Thanks Miranda.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting the Client"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Partnership Accepted"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le09ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Changing Topics "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In English, sometimes we need to interrupt people. This can be because we need to say something, express our opinion, or make a suggestion. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In a conversation, changing the topic is acceptable and perfectly normal. Once the other person has stopped speaking, you will need to return to the topic you were previously talking about.  <br /><br /> Here are some common ways you can do this: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">   Changing the topic   </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul> \\t<li> Speaking of \u2026  </li> \\t<li> By the way, \u2026  </li> \\t<li> On that note \u2026 </li> \\t<li> Oh, that reminds me \u2026 </li> \\t<li> But \u2026  </li>  </ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "\"We should have a party to celebrate the new contract.\""}, {"type": "example", "content": "\"Absolutely. <span class=\"underline\">Speaking of</span> parties, we need to find a good caterer.\" "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Giving and Exchanging Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own.  <br /><br /> Here are some ways you can ask for and give opinions: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">    Asking for Opinions     </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">    Giving Opinions     </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Always ask questions that encourage a response:</span>  <ul> \\t<li>What do you think about \u2026?</li> \\t<li>What do you think of \u2026 ?</li> \\t<li>How do you feel (about \u2026)? </li> \\t<li>Should I \u2026 ?</li> \\t<li>How do you want to \u2026 ?</li> \\t<li>How about you?</li> \\t</ul> \\t <span class=\\\"underline\\\">\\tUse tag questions</span><br />  <span class=\\\"underline\\\">1. positive verb + negative tag</span><br /> Use this when you think the other person will agree by saying 'yes'<br /> <ul> \\t<li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">were</span> taken by surprise, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">weren't you</span>? </li></span> \\t</ul> <span class=\\\"underline\\\">2. negative verb + positive tag </span><br /> Use this when you think the other person will agree by saying \u2018no' <br /> <ul> \\t<li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">weren't </span>taken by surprise, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">were you</span>? </li> \\t</ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">When you give opinions, make your opinions less forceful by using neutral statements:</span>  <ul> \\t<li>I could \u2026 (+verb) </li> \\t<li>This/That was \u2026 (+ adjective + noun)</li> \\t<li>I think \u2026 (+clause) </li> \\t<li>I must say I \u2026 (+verb phrase)</li> \\t<li>To be honest \u2026 (+clause)</li> \\t<li>(clause) \u2026 if you ask me. </li> \\t<li>I could be wrong, but \u2026 (+clause) </li> \\t<li>I felt that \u2026 (+clause) </li> \\t</ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jay</span>: \"I'm happy we got the contract.\""}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: \"You <span class=\"strong\">were</span> taken by surprise, <span class=\"strong\">weren't you</span>?\""}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jay</span>: \"<span class=\"strong\">I must say</span> that I was. <span class=\"strong\">I thought </span>they would offer the contract to our competitor.\""}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "luncheon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a formal lunch"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should plan a luncheon for when Peter gets back."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when planning the food needed for a party."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "caterer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or company whose job is to provide food and drinks at a business meeting or special occasion "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Should I look into hiring a caterer? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vegan "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who does not eat any animal products such as meat, milk or eggs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are some vegans in the company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vegetarian "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eating no meat or fish"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm vegetarian and don't eat meat. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gluten-free "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eating no foods that contain a sticky substance which is found in wheat flour"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm on a gluten-free diet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "high protein "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " eating foods that contain substances your body needs in order to grow and remain strong "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think she's on a high protein diet so we need to."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "low-sodium "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eating foods that contain a small amount of salt"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm on a low-sodium diet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "low-fat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "eating foods that contain a small amount of oily substances"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How do you feel about following a low-fat diet?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le09ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Plan a small office party to celebrate a new achievement. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose the type of party you want to have. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of things you want to have at the party (for example: type of music, kind of music, location, etc.) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Have a conversation with a partner about the type of party you want to have. Ask and exchange opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Interrupt your partner, change topics and get back to the topic when it is appropriate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, make sure you have made all the decisions and arrangements for the party."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I plan a small office party. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I choose the music and location for the party. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I have a conversation with a party about a party I will plan."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I interrupt a conversation, change topics and return to a topic."}]}]}